### Set status diversity
### Confirm 4 orders
POST {{order_service}}/orders/{{createOrder1.response.body.$.id}}/confirm/ HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser1.response.body.$.access}}

POST {{order_service}}/orders/{{createOrder2.response.body.$.id}}/confirm/ HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser1.response.body.$.access}}

POST {{order_service}}/orders/{{createOrder3.response.body.$.id}}/confirm/ HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser1.response.body.$.access}}

POST {{order_service}}/orders/{{createOrder4.response.body.$.id}}/confirm/ HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser1.response.body.$.access}}

### Cancel 3 orders (ModelViewSet PATCH)
PATCH {{order_service}}/orders/{{createOrder5.response.body.$.id}}/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser1.response.body.$.access}}

{
    "status": "Cancelled"
}

PATCH {{order_service}}/orders/{{createOrder6.response.body.$.id}}/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser1.response.body.$.access}}

{
    "status": "Cancelled"
}

PATCH {{order_service}}/orders/{{createOrder7.response.body.$.id}}/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser1.response.body.$.access}}

{
    "status": "Cancelled"
}

